                "text": ".@SpeakerPelosi broke the mold when she ascended twice to the role that placed her third in line to the presidency. A trailblazer who made it possible for more than 20 million people to finally get quality, affordable health care. She is a leader who pledged her two tenures as Speaker \u201cfor the children\u201d and inspired millions of women and girls to see that the sky was the limit for them, when dreaming and aspiring towards their goals. Steve and I and our children wish Speaker Pelosi, Paul, their kids and grandkids the best as they welcome well-earned time together.",
